        <p>WEST LANCASHIRE WAR HOSPITAL FUND. WARRINGTON BRANCH. £ s. d. . Amount 'preViously acknowledged 135 15 7 Major G. R. Crosfleld Part proceeds of Whist Drive, per Mrs. Lindley and Mrs. Locker (for comforts for mine sweepers) Mrs. Harold Joseph • 3 3 0 Robert Kennon Mrs. Arthur Bennett Mrs. Hy. Roberts Mrs. Tracey Forster Collected at Appleton Rifle Club Range</p>
