        <p>COUNTY BOROUGH OF WARRINGTON. The HEALTH COMMITTEE hereby invite TENDERS for the supply of the under- ' mentioned Goods, to be used in the Corporation Hospitals, for periods of 3 and 6 months, com- mencing let January, 1915:— GROCERIES. PROVISIONS. CLEANING MATERIALS. BREAD AND FLOUR. • MILK. FISH. GAME AND POULTRY. MEAT. Full particulars and forms (on which alone tenders are to be made) to be obtained at the Health Department Office, Sankey-street. The forms to be put in envelopes, sealed and endorsed "Tenders for Provisions." and ad- dressed to "The Chairman of the Health Com- mittee." No tender will be considered that arrives at the above-named address after 4 o'clock, Tues- day. December- Ist. The greatest stringency will be observed in maintaining the rules laid down. G. W. N. JOSEPH, Medical Superintendent of Corporation Hospitals.</p>
