        <p>GOOD NEWS! wE are commencing our 9th Annual Adver- tising Sale To-Day, when we shall offer all our goods at Special Advertising Prices. We should like to state that we have been fortunate enough to have bought all goods for present season before the Declaration of War, thereby saving from 10 to 25 per cent. advance in prices.. We have large stocks of Men's and Ladles' Woollen Underwear at Special Prices, all woollen goods to-day being worth 25 per cent. more than they were la short time ago. All other classes of goods have been well bought, and it will pay you to visit us, see our prices and com- pare qualities. PLEASE NOTE.—We do not buy job special goods for this Advertising Sale, but offer all our good stock, regular numbers, at Special Prices. Our advice to all thoughtful householders is to buy all woollen and linen goods at one.), as prices will be much higher in the early months of 1915. Assuring you that we can give better value than most drapers in the trade, we ask you to come and see for yourselves.</p>
